리","x":1416,"y":709,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"알려진","x":1501,"y":707,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"몇몇","x":1626,"y":707,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"문","x":1710,"y":710,"width":37,"height":34}]},{"text":"제를 동적 계획법으로 해결하는 방법에 대해 알아보겠습니다.","words":[{"text":"제를","x":227,"y":789,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"동적","x":310,"y":789,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"계획법으로","x":393,"y":789,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"해결하는","x":577,"y":787,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"방법에","x":721,"y":785,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"대해","x":834,"y":784,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"알아보겠습니다.","x":913,"y":784,"width":248,"height":39}]},{"text":"STRUCTURES \u0026 ALGORITHMS","words":[{"text":"STRUCTURES","x":1213,"y":1057,"width":196,"height":23},{"text":"\u0026","x":1430,"y":1057,"width":15,"height":18},{"text":"ALGORITHMS","x":1465,"y":1056,"width":202,"height":20}]},{"text":"들어가며","words":[{"text":"들어가며","x":450,"y":1123,"width":259,"height":74}]},{"text":"은 프로그래머가 좋아하기도 하고 동시에 두려워하기도 하는 동적 계획법(dvnanuc proglamming)","words":[{"text":"은","x":263,"y":1304,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"프로그래머가","x":304,"y":1304,"width":208,"height":37},{"text":"좋아하기도","x":522,"y":1304,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"하고","x":701,"y":1304,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"동시에","x":779,"y":1304,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"두려워하기도","x":895,"y":1304,"width":209,"height":39},{"text":"하는","x":1117,"y":1305,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"동적","x":1198,"y":1305,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"계획법(dvnanuc","x":1280,"y":1303,"width":235,"height":35},{"text":"proglamming)","x":1529,"y":1304,"width":209,"height":35}]},{"text":"。 분할 정복 패러다임 개념을 확장한 것으로, 특정 분류의 문제에 시용됩니다. 동적 계획법 문제","words":[{"text":"。","x":233,"y":1380,"width":15,"height":12},{"text":"분할","x":268,"y":1375,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"정복","x":352,"y":1376,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"패러다임","x":433,"y":1377,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"개념을","x":580,"y":1377,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"확장한","x":691,"